  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy Contract: Formulation of Ukraine Peace and Stabilization Programme 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation of a total Program document of a maximum of 20 pages plus associated annexes. The program document must be designed in accordance with the guidelines in the &quot;Guidelines for Country Strategic Frameworks and Projects&quot;.

- Particular emphasis is placed on:
- Strengthened connectivity according to Identification Note (February 2021), including focus on WPS, veterans and youth and women as a target group.
- Opportunity for increased Danish visibility.
- Adaptive management that allows for adjustments along the way in light of any changing needs and priorities.
- Promotion of synergy with other Danish-supported initiatives in Ukraine under the Neighborhood Program as well as international initiatives in the field of defence &#x2013; as well as in the civilian field.</narrative>
  </description>
